For n a power of 2, a(n) = n. If n is not a power of 2, a(n) is the smallest number not yet in the sequence which shares a decimal digit and a prime factor with n, and has the same binary weight.

The 64 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

